【P1·guidance】物流NOT_FOUND≠未发货；DELIVERED≠客户确认。
【P1·reads】调查进展：订单=未读;物流=已读;退款=未读;材料=未读;政策=未读
【P1·request】当前诉求：SYNTHETIC_REPLAY: claim_repair
revision=1
【P1·turn_0】[assistant] READ_TOOL get_shipment_trace
【P2·fact】{"authority":"AUTHORITY","ref":"O1","source_type":"ORDER_LINE","source_version":"3","tool":"get_shipment_trace"}
shipment_carrier_conclusion=LOST; shipment_status=LOST
【P3·observation:get_shipment_trace】引用元数据：{"read_ref":"O1"}
get_shipment_trace: {}
字段 carrier_conclusion,status 已在P2；原文可按此Observation编号读回

